// stage0: skip
// std::cli: possible values, ranges, conflicts, requirements, environment
// variables, value names, the help subcommand, a required subcommand; the expected lines are clap 4.6's
// output for the same program.
// out: $ --mode fast -l 3 --list a,b --list c --pair k v run
// out: mode=Some("fast") level=Some(3) json=false user=None pass=None list=Some(["a", "b", "c"]) pair=Some(["k", "v"]) sub=Some("run")
// out: $ --mode fats run
// out: exit 2 ---
// out: error: invalid value 'fats' for '--mode <mode>'
// out:   [possible values: fast, slow]
