// out: For more information, try '--help'.
// out: ---
// out: $ --json --yaml run
// out: exit 2 ---
// out: error: the argument '--json' cannot be used with '--yaml'
// out:
// out: Usage: tool --json <COMMAND>
// out:
// out: For more information, try '--help'.
// out: ---
// out: $ --user u run
// out: exit 2 ---
// out: error: the following required arguments were not provided:
// out:   --pass <pass>
// out:
// out: Usage: tool --pass <pass> --user <user> <COMMAND>
// out:
// out: For more information, try '--help'.
// out: ---
// out: $ --mode slow
// out: exit 2 ---
// out: error: 'tool' requires a subcommand but one was not provided
// out:   [subcommands: run, stop, help]
// out:
// out: Usage: tool [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
// out:
// out: For more information, try '--help'.
// out: ---
// out: $ --help
// out: exit 0 ---
// out: A tool
// out:
// out: Usage: tool [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
