// out: Commands:
// out:   run   Runs
// out:   stop  Stops
// out:   help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
// out:
// out: Options:
// out:       --mode <mode>    Mode [possible values: fast, slow]
// out:   -l, --level <level>  Level
// out:       --json           
// out:       --yaml           
// out:       --user <user>    
// out:       --pass <pass>    [env: TOOL_PASS_XYZ=]
// out:       --list <list>    
// out:       --pair <K> <V>   
// out:   -h, --help           Print help
// out: ---
// out: $ help run
// out: exit 0 ---
// out: Runs
// out:
// out: Usage: tool run [OPTIONS]
